# ZacAi Heart Core README

The `src/ai/` directory is the **standalone, self-reliant Heart** of ZacAi—a bulletproof orchestration model that coordinates hybrid AI modules, tools, and agents while remaining fully operational even when everything else is offline. It acts as the expert conductor, SRE, and system kernel for the entire stack.

## Core Principles

- **Self-Reliance**: Heart runs independently with internal LM, system knowledge, and virtual tools. External modules (HCO, LLeMuR, VCFLOW) are enhancements, not dependencies.
- **Separation of Concerns**: Each folder owns one responsibility; `orchestration/mainOrchestrator.ts` composes them via typed contracts.
- **Hot-Swap Ready**: Modules register dynamically via `core/system-model.ts`; no Heart code changes needed for new tools/agents.
- **Self-Healing**: Continuous detection-diagnosis-remediation loop stabilizes the stack autonomously.

