                                              - **Config-driven, not code-driven integration**  
                                                - New domains or tools are mostly added via config entries in `core/system-model` (with pointers to implementations), not changes to orchestrator code.  
                                                  - This keeps the Heart stable and reduces the chance that integrating something new breaks your base.  

